1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,540
Good morning, everyone, and
welcome to Maple Ridge Nature Reserve.

2
00:00:04,019 --> 00:00:05,539
Take a look at the map you were given.

3
00:00:05,959 --> 00:00:09,940
We're standing at the entrance, on
the south side, beside the main car park,

4
00:00:10,270 --> 00:00:12,960
and the path runs in a ring
all the way around the lake.

5
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:16,000
If you turn right as you
come through the gate,

6
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:19,900
the first thing you'll reach is the
picnic area, tables under the trees.

7
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:21,680
That's where we'll meet for lunch.

8
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:25,880
If you turn left instead, a short walk
brings you to the children's playground,

9
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:28,120
with swings and a small climbing frame.

10
00:00:28,445 --> 00:00:32,520
Keep following that left-hand path, and
it curves up the western side of the lake,

11
00:00:32,645 --> 00:00:33,925
where you'll find the boathouse.

12
00:00:34,265 --> 00:00:36,100
Rowing boats can be
hired there in the summer.

13
00:00:36,485 --> 00:00:40,060
Right at the top of the ring, directly
opposite where we're standing now,

14
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:44,160
is the bird hide, a quiet wooden
shelter for watching waterfowl.

15
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:46,700
The viewing platform
isn't on the path at all.

16
00:00:46,950 --> 00:00:50,480
It's on the little island in the middle
of the lake, and you reach it by boat.

17
00:00:50,795 --> 00:00:54,220
Between the boathouse and the
bird hide, on the inside of the path,

18
00:00:54,369 --> 00:00:56,300
close to the water, is the waterfall.

19
00:00:56,655 --> 00:00:59,020
Especially impressive after heavy rain.

20
00:00:59,021 --> 00:01:02,900
Just beyond it, further out in the woods
on the north-western edge of the reserve,

21
00:01:03,049 --> 00:01:05,160
is the campsite, for overnight stays.

22
00:01:05,459 --> 00:01:08,880
On the opposite side, to the
north-east, stands the old mill,

23
00:01:09,229 --> 00:01:12,380
a restored building that once
used the stream to power machinery.

24
00:01:12,804 --> 00:01:16,180
If you're arriving by car later
on, and the main car park is full,

25
00:01:16,509 --> 00:01:19,160
go right from the entrance,
past the picnic area,

26
00:01:19,469 --> 00:01:22,140
and a little further on you'll
find the overflow car park.

27
00:01:22,459 --> 00:01:25,800
And halfway up the eastern side
of the lake is the lookout tower,

28
00:01:26,049 --> 00:01:28,380
the best place for
photographs on a clear day.

29
00:01:28,719 --> 00:01:31,020
Now let's turn to the
Lakeview Visitor Centre.

30
00:01:31,539 --> 00:01:34,000
You come in through the
entrance hall on the south side,

31
00:01:34,249 --> 00:01:36,680
and the large room in the
middle is the exhibition hall.

32
00:01:37,079 --> 00:01:38,840
The other rooms are arranged around it.

33
00:01:39,300 --> 00:01:41,620
People expect the shop to be by the door,

34
00:01:41,809 --> 00:01:45,200
but it's actually in the far right-hand
corner at the back of the building.

35
00:01:45,519 --> 00:01:47,520
The toilets are on
your left as you come in,

36
00:01:47,639 --> 00:01:49,040
in the corner nearest the entrance.

37
00:01:49,579 --> 00:01:52,160
The cafe is on the
right-hand side, halfway along,

38
00:01:52,289 --> 00:01:55,180
between the shop and the room
nearest the entrance on that side.

39
00:01:55,464 --> 00:01:58,760
Along the back wall, there are
two larger rooms side by side.

40
00:01:59,094 --> 00:02:01,520
The lecture room is the
left-hand one of those two,

41
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:02,720
not the one in the corner.

42
00:02:02,899 --> 00:02:05,520
The children's activity
room is on the left-hand wall,

43
00:02:05,664 --> 00:02:07,540
between the toilets and the corner room.

44
00:02:07,939 --> 00:02:12,092
The temporary exhibition is in the right-hand
room of the two along the back wall.

45
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:15,540
The permanent exhibition
fills the back left-hand corner.

46
00:02:16,010 --> 00:02:19,100
The first aid room is on the
right-hand side, nearest the entrance.

47
00:02:19,549 --> 00:02:22,240
Behind the exhibition hall,
there are two small rooms.

48
00:02:22,635 --> 00:02:25,280
The one on the right, just in
front of the temporary exhibition,

49
00:02:25,710 --> 00:02:27,640
is the resource room for school groups.

50
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:30,980
And the other small room,
on the left, is the staff office.

51
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,440
That's everything for now.

52
00:02:32,725 --> 00:02:34,300
Enjoy your visit to Maple Ridge.

